# Additional private sweep configs and their state (one per target).
# The example config is the public worked example; these are live targeting.
# Both separators: the dotted form was the original convention, but live
# profiles are named with underscores (candidates_leadership.json,
# state_leadership/) and were committable until these lines existed.
config.*.json
config_*.json
candidates.*.json
candidates_*.json
state-*/
state_*/
